/express/issues/6222","id":2572499602,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAOeZ86ZVTqS","user":{"login":"cdavid15","id":3115533,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMTU1MzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3115533?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15","html_url":"https://github.com/cdavid15","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T07:55:45Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T07:56:40Z","body":"Can you confirm this is fixed as our NexusIQ scan is flagging this and we are currently on 4.21.2:\r\n\r\n> ### Advisory Deviation Notice:\r\n> The Sonatype Security Research team discovered that this vulnerability was introduced in version `3.0.0-beta4` and does not affect all versions through `3.1.24` as stated in the advisory. Additionally, the team discovered that this vulnerability affects all available `4.x` and `5.x` versions.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expressjs/express/issues/comments/2572499602/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expressjs/express/issues/comments/2573292036","html_url":"https://github.com/expressjs/express/issues/6222#issuecomment-2573292036","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expressjs/express/issues/6222","id":2573292036,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAOeZ86ZYVIE","user":{"login":"wesleytodd","id":1027776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjc3NzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1027776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesleytodd","html_url":"https://github.com/wesleytodd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesleytodd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesleytodd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesleytodd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesleytodd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesleytodd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesleytodd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesleytodd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesleytodd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesleytodd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T15:01:00Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T15:01:22Z","body":"As you can read from the vulnerability [report here](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2024-10491) or [here](https://www.herodevs.com/vulnerability-directory/cve-2024-10491), this does not impact express after version `3.21.2`. If Nexus or some other vendor thinks they have a new report or this impacts more than the verified range they should use our standard security reporting methods so we can properly address it. Please reach out to them and tell them to either correct their mistake or responsibly disclose the issue. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expressjs/express/issues/comments/2573292036/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expressjs/express/issues/comments/2574716032","html_url":"https://github.com/expressjs/express/issues/6222#issuecomment-2574716032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expressjs/express/issues/6222","id":2574716032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAOeZ86ZdwyA","user":{"login":"cdavid15","id":3115533,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMTU1MzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3115533?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15","html_url":"https://github.com/cdavid15","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cdavid15/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T08:50:00Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T08:50:00Z","body":"@wesleytodd - thanks for your prompt response and clarification regarding this issue and its impact on Express `4.21.2`.\r\n\r\nYour explanation confirms what I had begun to suspect - that this issue was indeed fixed after version `3.21.2` and is **NOT** a current vulnerability requiring a fix for `4.x` or `5.x`.\r\n\r\nI will escalate this with our cyber team to address the discrepancy in NexusIQ's scan and request that they contact the vendor to highlight the incorrect flagging of this issue. I will also ask them to suggest that the vendor use your standard security reporting methods if they genuinely believe this to be a valid concern identified by their team.\r\n\r\nIt is frustrating that our software could be incorrectly flagged as vulnerable due to potential inaccuracies within NexusIQ as this undermines trust in a tool that should be relied upon to provide accurate and verified data.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expressjs/express/issues/comments/2574716032/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expressjs/express/issues/comments/2623693299","html_url":"https://github.com/expressjs/express/issues/6222#issuecomment-2623693299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expressjs/express/issues/6222","id":2623693299,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAOeZ86cYmHz","user":{"login":"lroal","id":631501,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMTUwMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/631501?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lroal","html_url":"https://github.com/lroal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lroal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lroal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lroal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lroal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lroal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lroal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lroal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lroal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lroal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T07:16:50Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T07:16:50Z","body":"It still reports the vulnerability at 5.x. Is it a false positive ?\nCVE-2024-10491 (OSSINDEX)  suppress\n\nA vulnerability has been identified in the Express response.links function, allowing for arbitrary resource injection in the Link header when unsanitized data is used.\n\nThe issue arises from improper sanitization in `Link` header values, which can allow a combination of characters like `,`, `;`, and `<>` to preload malicious resources.\n\nThis vulnerability is especially relevant for dynamic parameters.\n\nSonatype's research suggests that this CVE's details differ from those defined at NVD. See https://ossindex.sonatype.org/vulnerability/CVE-2024-10491 for details\nCWE-74 Improper Neutralization of Special Elements in Output Used by a Downstream Component ('Injection')\n\nCVSSv3:\nBase Score: MEDIUM (5.300000190734863)\nVector: CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:L/A:N\n\nReferences:\nOSSINDEX - [[CVE-2024-10491] CWE-74: Improper Neutralization of Special Elements in Output Used by a Downstream Component ('Injection')](https://ossindex.sonatype.org/vulnerability/CVE-2024-10491?component-type=npm&component-name=express&utm_source=dependency-check&utm_medium=integration&utm_content=11.0.0)\nOSSIndex - http://web.nvd.nist.gov/view/vuln/detail?vulnId=CVE-2024-10491\nOSSIndex - https://www.herodevs.com/vulnerability-directory/cve-2024-10491\nVulnerable Software & Versions (OSSINDEX):\n\ncpe:2.3:a:*:express:5.0.1:*:*:*:*:*:*:*","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expressjs/express/issues/comments/2623693299/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expressjs/express/issues/comments/2634585646","html_url":"https://github.com/expressjs/express/issues/6222#issuecomment-2634585646","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/expressjs/express/issues/6222","id":2634585646,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAAOeZ86dCJYu","user":{"login":"wesleytodd","id":1027776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjc3NzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1027776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wesleytodd","html_url"